    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d109">

                <pb facs="0210" n="140" sameAs="frus:frus1919Parisv01/pg140"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source"> Edward M. House Papers: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">President Wilson to the Special Representative</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">House</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi>
                        </placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1918-11-25">November 25,
                            1918</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>17. Referring to my despatch 16 I shall sail directly for France as you
                    advised.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Wilson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
